  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-prompt-edit",
      "text": "adds in-place prompt editing to DeepSeek Harness\n\nclick the pencil on any user message, edit your text, enjoy"
    },
    {
      "section": "features",
      "text": "* **in-place edit:** tweak any past prompt directly in chat\n* **clean branch:** forks history at the target turn // no ghost turns, no corrupted logs\n* **keeps attachments:** images and files survive the edit intact\n* **auto-archive:** superseded sessions are tucked away into archive so your sidebar stays clean\n* **dsh-native:** blends with your active dark/light theme tokens\n* **ime-safe:** won't submit while picking pinyin / kanji characters\n* **multilingual:** en // zh // ru auto-detected"
    },
    {
      "section": "shortcuts",
      "text": "* `Enter` // submit (or close if unchanged)\n* `Shift + Enter` // new line\n* `Ctrl + Enter` // quick submit\n* `Escape` // cancel"
    },
    {
      "section": "install",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:perdakovich/dsh-prompt-edit\n```\n\nrestart `dsh web` and refresh the page."
    },
    {
      "section": "how it works",
      "text": "1. cuts the session history right before the edited turn\n2. spawns a clean child session with your updated prompt and attachments\n3. archives the old session branch"
    },
    {
